    "turn_text": "have i guess the good thing is Nancy Pelosi's coming down to to campaign for your opponent so he's got to work with that but but i'll tell you this congressman i want to ask you about the most important issue in at your district because it democrats have made it really clear that whether or not they want to publicly acknowledge it if they win in november if they If they take a seat like yours, which is so important for Republicans to hold on to, they're going to try to impeach this president. And if they're not going to go after him with impeachment right away, they're going to go after him with investigations into everything. We've already seen this list of 100 plus investigations into tax returns. Jared Kushner, the list goes on and on and on. What is the issue that you want to make this race about? Or is it about the resistance to the resistance when it comes to the impeachment or impending peachment of the of the president?",
